-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">906</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">113</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">183<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">gpu</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">7,615</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">7,124</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">282.8</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">257w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">4,552</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">180.7</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">257w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">4k</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,824</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">72.4</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">257w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">6,824</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">116.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">210w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">4,849</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">81.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">210w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">4k</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">2,860</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">48.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">210w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">The Cougar Dust 2 case (2022 model, recently discontinued and only available from Gigaparts at $122USD) is relatively easy to disassemble with toolless side panels and clamps. The case supports up to 280mm AIOs and 2.9-slot GPUs up to 330mm long. The RTX 2080ti Gaming OC is a solid 2.5-slot card at 286.5mm with fine performance for 1440p gaming, though it exhibits aggressive fan curve behavior (near silent to full power at 70C). After replacing thermal pads and paste, GPU temps improved by ~5C and now stay under 75C during stress testing. The i7-12700k paired with the cheaper ASRock Z690M-ITX/AC motherboard and DDR4 memory creates a strong 1440p gaming system with acceptable thermals despite negative pressure. The case offers excellent build quality with an ammo box theme and ample component room. Key limitations include no bottom fan intake capability, a PCIe Gen 3 riser cable (should support Gen 4 for modern GPUs), and a custom 21mm riser connector design with no third-party alternatives. Overall, the case is functional with more positives than negatives, though the proprietary riser cable and lack of Gen 4 support are notable shortcomings for future GPU upgrades.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">20,557</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-green\" style=\"width:79%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->21<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">112.3</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">22<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">282.8<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-accent\" style=\"width:56%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->44<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">1.1</span> fps/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium te